{
  "info": {
    "name": "Coursary API",
    "description": "Rotas da coursary-api. Importe no Yaak (Import > Postman) e o baseUrl aponta para o domínio de `dev`; em `prod`, use https://api.coursary.joaodevdude.com.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://api-dev.coursary.joaodevdude.com"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": "<accessToken do sign-in>"
    },
    {
      "key": "accountId",
      "value": "<id da conta alvo>"
    },
    {
      "key": "courseId",
      "value": "<id do curso>"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
            "description": ""
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Sign up",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Ana Souza\",\n  \"email\": \"ana@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"secret123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/sign-up",
            "description": "201 { accountId }. 409 EMAIL_IN_USE, 400 VALIDATION, 400 INVALID_PASSWORD, 429 TOO_MANY_REQUESTS."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Confirm sign-up",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"ana@example.com\",\n  \"code\": \"123456\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/confirm",
            "description": "204. 400 INVALID_CODE (código errado, expirado, ou sem cadastro pendente), 400 VALIDATION, 429 TOO_MANY_REQUESTS."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Resend confirmation code",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"ana@example.com\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/resend-code",
            "description": "204 sempre, exista ou não um cadastro pendente. 400 VALIDATION, 429 TOO_MANY_REQUESTS."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Sign in",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"ana@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"secret123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/sign-in",
            "description": "200 { accessToken, refreshToken, expiresIn }. 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS, 403 EMAIL_NOT_CONFIRMED, 403 ACCOUNT_UNAVAILABLE, 429 TOO_MANY_REQUESTS. Sessão única: os tokens de um sign-in anterior deixam de valer (401 INVALID_SESSION)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh tokens",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"<refreshToken do sign-in>\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh",
            "description": "200 { accessToken, refreshToken, expiresIn }: guarde o refreshToken novo, o antigo deixa de valer (rotação). 401 INVALID_SESSION, 403 ACCOUNT_UNAVAILABLE. O access token anterior deixa de valer; um refresh token de sessão anterior responde 401 INVALID_SESSION."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Forgot password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"ana@example.com\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password",
            "description": "204 sempre; o código só é enviado a uma conta ativa. 400 VALIDATION, 429 TOO_MANY_REQUESTS."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"ana@example.com\",\n  \"code\": \"123456\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"newsecret1\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password",
            "description": "204, e todas as sessões anteriores são encerradas. 400 INVALID_CODE, 400 INVALID_PASSWORD, 400 VALIDATION, 429 TOO_MANY_REQUESTS. Apaga a sessão: todos os tokens anteriores deixam de valer."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Account",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me",
            "description": "200 { id, name, email, role, createdAt }. 401 sem token ou token inválido (API Gateway), 403 com o id token (escopo) ou conta indisponível (ACCOUNT_UNAVAILABLE)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update me",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Ana Souza\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/me",
            "description": "200 com o perfil atualizado. 400 VALIDATION, 401, 403 como no Get me."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Admin",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List users",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/users?role=student&status=ACTIVE&limit=20",
            "description": "200 { items: [{ id, name, email, role, status, createdAt }], nextCursor }, mais recentes primeiro. role obrigatório; status (PENDING, ACTIVE, DISABLED) e limit (1 a 100, padrão 20) opcionais; para a próxima página, cursor=<nextCursor>. Página curta com nextCursor é normal. 400 VALIDATION, 400 INVALID_CURSOR, 401, 403 FORBIDDEN (sem a permissão users:list)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Find user by e-mail",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/users/by-email?email=ana@example.com",
            "description": "200 { id, name, email, role, status, createdAt }. 404 ACCOUNT_NOT_FOUND, 400 VALIDATION, 401, 403 FORBIDDEN."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Change role",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"role\": \"instructor\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{accountId}}/role",
            "description": "200 { id, role } (mesmo papel: 200 sem gravar). 403 CANNOT_CHANGE_OWN_ROLE, 404 ACCOUNT_NOT_FOUND, 409 ACCOUNT_NOT_ACTIVE, 409 CONFLICT (a conta mudou no meio), 403 FORBIDDEN (sem a permissão ou deixou de ser admin), 400 VALIDATION, 401."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List role changes",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{accountId}}/role-changes?limit=20",
            "description": "200 { items: [{ id, fromRole, toRole, changedBy, changedAt }], nextCursor }, mais recentes primeiro. changedBy é o id do admin ou bootstrap. 404 ACCOUNT_NOT_FOUND, 400 INVALID_CURSOR, 401, 403 FORBIDDEN."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Disable user",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{accountId}}/disable",
            "description": "200 { id, status: DISABLED }; já desativada: 200 sem gravar. A sessão é apagada: toda rota privada responde 403 ACCOUNT_UNAVAILABLE na hora, o refresh 401 e o sign-in 403. 403 CANNOT_CHANGE_OWN_STATUS, 404 ACCOUNT_NOT_FOUND, 409 ACCOUNT_NOT_ACTIVE (conta pendente), 409 CONFLICT (a conta mudou no meio), 403 FORBIDDEN (sem a permissão users:change-status ou deixou de ser admin ativo), 401."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Enable user",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{accountId}}/enable",
            "description": "200 { id, status: ACTIVE }; já ativa: 200 sem gravar; a sessão antiga não volta, é preciso entrar de novo. 403 CANNOT_CHANGE_OWN_STATUS, 404 ACCOUNT_NOT_FOUND, 409 ACCOUNT_NOT_ACTIVE (conta pendente), 409 CONFLICT (a conta mudou no meio), 403 FORBIDDEN (sem a permissão users:change-status ou deixou de ser admin ativo), 401."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Courses",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create course",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"DynamoDB na prática\",\n  \"description\": \"Chaves, índices e transações.\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/courses",
            "description": "201 com o curso (DRAFT, instructorName copiado da conta). Título 3 a 120, descrição até 5.000 (opcional). 400 VALIDATION, 401, 403 FORBIDDEN (sem courses:create: aluno)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update course",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"DynamoDB na prática, 2ª edição\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}",
            "description": "200 com o curso inteiro. Título e/ou descrição. Dono ou admin. Curso alheio em rascunho 404 COURSE_NOT_FOUND, publicado ou arquivado 403 FORBIDDEN; arquivado 409 COURSE_ARCHIVED (também para o admin). 400 VALIDATION (id malformado ou corpo vazio), 401."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "My courses",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/instructor/courses?limit=20",
            "description": "200 { items: [{ id, title, status, lessonCount, enrollmentCount, publishedAt, createdAt }], nextCursor }, mais recentes primeiro, todos os status. 400 INVALID_CURSOR, 401, 403 FORBIDDEN (aluno)."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
